      {
        "q": "4-6-7-3. Berms.",
        "a": "Where used, berms shall be created and maintained to have a natural appearance, with variations in the berm ridge line and in the berm height. Berms shall have a maximum slope of 4:1 and shall be planted to prevent erosion with appropriate trees, shrubs, groundcovers, and/or grasses as determined by the Director."
